## 7. Federated lock flow

Пример StreamBlock:

```text
UI -> RSM acquire (local cameraId)
  -> ENM origin: FederatedProjection
  -> RSM -> FGS(SRVI) ApplyStreamBlock
  -> FGS(SRVI) -> regional RSM (S2S)
  -> ACK / compensation
  -> RSM(SRVI) journal
```

Idempotency: `federation-streamblock:{operationId}`.

Статусы: `PendingRemote`, `RemoteFailed`, `Compensating`.

**Archive lock:** одна активная lease на камеру (v1); второй acquire с другим интервалом = replace.

**StreamBlock:** coupled Archive lock на регионе за период SB.

