## 3. Feature gates и permissions

### 3.1. License features

| Feature | Источник | Влияние на UI |
|---------|----------|---------------|
| `FEDERATION` | `GET /licenses/license/status` → `features["FEDERATION"]` | Admin `/federation/*`, badges, фильтр региона |
| `PPUV` | LCS | ППУВ кнопки и locks |

```text
federationAdminUi   = hasFederationLicense
federationCatalogUi = hasFederationLicense && hasConfiguredPeers
federationPpuvUi    = hasFederationLicense && hasPpuvLicense && userHasPpuvOperate
```

`GET /rsm/api/v1/federation/status` или непустой `GET /federation/installations` → `hasConfiguredPeers`.

### 3.2. JWT scopes (ППУВ)

| Scope | UI |
|-------|-----|
| `ppuv:operate` | Acquire/release locks |
| `ppuv:stream-block` | StreamBlock |
| `ppuv:archive:seize` | Archive lock |
| `ppuv:preempt` | Preempt (если есть в продукте) |

Federation **не добавляет** отдельных user scopes — remote вызовы идут service principal через FGS.

